### Create a new purchase request
POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/purchase-requests/PurchaseRequestsSet
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic Rajesh:2610

{
    "requestNo": "PR-1009",
    "requesterName": "Spiderman",
    "requesterEmail": "Spiderman@test.com",
    "department_code": "IT",
    "itemName": "Macbook",
    "itemCategory_code": "LAPTOP",
    "quantity": 1,
    "estimatedAmount": 22000,
    "currency": "INR",
    "requestDate": "2026-12-25",
    "requiredByDate": "2026-12-27",
    "businessJustification": "Need laptop for project",
    "status": ""
}



